Name: GodSimplex~
Rooms:
  Board:
    Description:-
      The main gathering place of the gods. Messages are exchanged here
      every day. The mortal board is east, the meeting room south, the Inn
      north, and the post office west.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: Inn~
      East: Mortalboard~
      South: Meeting~
      West: PostOffice~
      Up: Social~
      Down: midgaard:temple~
      ~
    Title: The Immortal Board Room~
    ~
  Inn:
    Description:-
      The Inn of the Gods is a small room holding a shelf of precious
      stones. When a god comes to rent belongings, their essence is stored
      in the stones.
      ~
    Exits:
      South: Board~
      ~
    Title: The Inn of the Gods~
    ~
  IceBox:
    Description:-
      The Ice Box is for little boys and girls that cannot play nice. Be
      good and maybe someone will come and get you.
      ~
    Title: The Ice Box of the Gods~
    ~
  Meeting:
    Description:-
      The meeting room is plain and very simple. A circular table sits in
      the middle of the room, lit by an unseen light source. Many chairs
      surround the table, all empty.
      ~
    Exits:
      North: Board~
      ~
    Title: The Meeting Room of the Gods~
    ~
  Mortalboard:
    Description:-
      The gods have magically created an exact copy of the mortal board
      room. Any god can easily post and read messages here without being
      seen by mortals.
      ~
    Exits:
      West: Board~
      ~
    Title: The Gods' Mortal Board Room~
    ~
  PostOffice:
    Description:-
      The Post Office of the Gods is not as slow as mortal post offices.
      Piles of junk mail line the walls. Even gods get on mailing lists.
      ~
    Exits:
      East: Board~
      ~
    Title: The Post Office of the Gods~
    ~
  Social:
    Description:-
      This elegantly decorated room has one simple purpose: to socialize
      with everyone else around in one central location.
      ~
    Exits:
      Down: Board~
      ~
    Title: The Social Gathering Room~
    ~
  ~
~
